Package: criteriobrasil
Title: Tidy Tables from the Brazilian Economic Classification Criterion
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Vinicius", "Oike", , "viniciusoike@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tidy tables from the Brazilian Economic Classification
    Criterion (CCEB), including scoring rules, class cutoffs, income
    estimates, geographic distributions, edition selection, and offline
    deflation helpers.
